Package: linux-explorer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: john <verber001@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 14
Depends: bash, curl
Suggests: man-db, tealdeer, tldr
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/j-verb/linux-explorer
Description: interactive Bash command lookup utility
 A lightweight terminal utility for looking up commands on a Linux system.
 It shows the command location and summary, and offers shortcuts for man,
 tldr, and cht.sh reference material.
